<gml:bx action="off" break="yes"/><gml:hy mode="on" break="no"/><gml:hw word="ex-cep-tion-al" break="no"/>Hyphenation is now on for exceptional words.
<gml:hy mode="off" break="no"/><gml:cp n="5" unit="line" break="yes"/><gml:kp mode="on" break="yes"/>Kept text one.
Kept text two.
<gml:kp mode="off" break="yes"/><gml:ls spec="by 1.5" break="yes"/>Wider line spacing for a while so that a couple of lines of text show
the change in spacing between the lines of one paragraph.
<gml:br break="yes"/><gml:ls spec="normal" break="yes"/><gml:ws spec="by 2" break="no"/>Wide word spaces.
